# Cloudflare Pages response headers for the staff app (sds-pos.pages.dev).
# Vite copies this file to dist/, and Pages reads it from there.
# __API_HOST__ is replaced with the API hostname (repo variable API_HOST) by
# .github/workflows/deploy-web.yml after the build, and the deploy fails if it
# is still there. Add anything new the app loads (fonts, CDNs, Sentry ingest,
# push services) to the matching directive below, or the browser will block it.
# Pages always serves this app over HTTPS; HSTS keeps every device on it once it has seen one page.
# Nothing in the staff app asks for the permissions below, so they are disabled outright.
# Wake lock (kitchen display), clipboard-write and fullscreen stay at their default "self".
# profile.line-scdn.net serves the LINE avatars on kitchen tickets and the payment pop-up.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=(), hid=(), midi=(), display-capture=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://__API_HOST__ https://profile.line-scdn.net; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://__API_HOST__ wss://__API_HOST__; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
# The service worker file must always be revalidated, or a new version is found late.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
# The alert handlers the worker imports: revalidated too, or a fix reaches phones late.
/push-sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
